 "research_concepts": ["PNR fail as conditioning event", "PULL_UP as counter action", "defensive suppression", "counter-strategy lift in percentage points", "play-type possession labels derived from play-by-play", "unit-level consistency across teams or matchups"],
 "methodological_questions": [
  "Does a PNR-fail-then-PULL_UP sequence show positive lift over a matched baseline in at least 70% of units, with median lift above 2pp?",
  "What unit definition, minimum sample size and baseline are needed to estimate counter lift reliably?",
  "Are the PNR-fail and PULL_UP labels valid, and are they free of outcome-derived or assisted-flag artifacts?"
